This is the source code to version 1.3 of the 24-bit paint package 'Portrait'
written by Christopher January. The files contained in this archive as well
as this 'readme' file are Copyright © Christopher January and Atomice Software
1997-1999.
The most recent sources are available from:
http://portrait.fr.eu.org/atomice/archives
This contains the sources for 'Portrait' as well as other programs written
for the Amiga platform.

If you are a developer you may wish to register at:
http://portrait.fr.eu.org/atomice/programmers.html
which contains a list of active Amiga developers.

Distribution copies of 'Portrait' may be found on Aminet in gfx/edit, on
Aminet CD 30 in gfx/edit and on Amiga Format CD 35.

These files are for educational purposes only. If you have any queries then
don't hesitate to send me an E-mail at:
archives@atomice.fr.eu.org

